  "operative_text": "SECTION 1 (TCA 39-17-1359(a)(2)): Tennessee Code Annotated, Section 39-17-1359(a)(2), is amended by deleting the language \"§ 39-17-1366\" and substituting instead \"§ 39-17-1366, except those authorized to carry handguns under § 39-17-1350\".\nSECTION 2 (TCA 39-17-1311(b)(1)(D)): Tennessee Code Annotated, Section 39-17-1311(b)(1)(D), is amended by deleting the language \"in the discharge of their official duties\" and substituting instead \"in the discharge of their official duties or pursuant to § 39-17-1350\"."
